-- R-T2 (RULED 2026-09-06): WITHIN in both positions. On the act it bounds
-- each performance; after ONCE it bounds the STATE — one deadline on the
-- whole, not re-armed by each performance (spec §2.2.7.5 point 3).

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

-- each signature within 14 of the obligation arising; all of them within 30
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`sign, and be done by day 30` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        ONCE   ALL HAVE WITHIN 30
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH

-- the join's deadline may be computed; the act's is optional
GIVEN grace IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`sign within the grace period` grace MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        ONCE   ALL HAVE WITHIN grace PLUS 7
        HENCE  FULFILLED
